A ley line is a course of the [[Phenomena/Weave|weave]] running through the world. The fane at the center of [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/Orilon/index|Orilon]] was built directly on top of one. The [[Phenomena/Midnight Sun|Midnight Sun]] works only when it is planted at the center of a ley line; the blast then runs the length of the line, as it did through all of [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/index|Raelion]].
